Subject: Admit original frontend FE model owners and their presentation services
Upstream-base: 11c0bc65ad2ec21431c5d74f1ac4cbc1e3e2e2c3
Classification: temporary explicit original-source diagnostic admission; depends on 0543.

The Domination Choose Sides constructor calls the authored presentation
function StartHomeAwayCaptainHologramSequence, which creates the home/away
captain holograms through FE model services (1 create, 49/50 wait for the
model and its load, 31 position on a stadium marker, 30/34 default animation
and completion callback). Later transitions query and play their animations
(10, 17, 18, 45), set transforms (22), enable them (33) and release impostors
(2). The frontend task-cadence diagnostic also skipped the original
FrontEndTask FEModelManager::Update/Render, so no FE model could load or draw.

Under the new named MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_FRONTEND_FE_MODELS admission, keep
the original FrontEndTask model update/render (including its HBM guard) and
the FEModelManager-only VM services 1, 2, 10, 17, 18, 22, 30, 31, 33, 34, 45,
49 and 50. Every other service keeps its current guard, including world
animation (16), emissions (12, 14, 43), trophies and cup cameras.

